**One-paper feasibility is not yet established.** The gross A001+A002 sources contain approximately **40,582 words** and **152 inventoried formal rows** before de-duplication and publication rewriting. A theorem atlas cannot retain all of that material in one ordinary article merely by moving proofs to a supplement.

